{"seq":1,"slug":"why-nonlinear-dynamics","title":"为何非线性动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/foundations/why-nonlinear-dynamics","wordCount":1400,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何非线性动力学\">为何非线性动力学</h1><p>把两块石头同时丢进平静的水面，两圈波纹相遇处会简单地叠加——这是线性世界的承诺：整体等于部分之和。可把火苗凑近另一团火，得到的不是两倍的火而是一场失控的燃烧；把两个略有差异的钟摆用弹簧连起来，它们会突然同步或突然反相。一旦系统的演化规律里出现了状态量自身的乘积、幂次、三角函数或饱和，叠加原理就失效了，而失效之处恰恰是这门学科的入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-线性的承诺与它的边界\">核心概念：线性的承诺与它的边界</h2><p>一个动力系统由状态变量随时间的演化规则刻画。若规则可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{x} = A x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>（连续时间）或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{n+1} = A x_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（离散时间），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是与状态无关的矩阵，系统就是<strong>线性</strong>的。线性系统有三条几乎免费的好处：解可以解析写出（矩阵指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{At}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或幂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；满足叠加——若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 都是解，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha x + \\beta y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 也是解；长期行为完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的特征值决定，只有「衰减、增长、振荡」这几种命运，绝不会出现混沌。</p>\n<p>正因如此，工程教育花大量篇幅训练线性近似：在工作点附近把非线性项 Taylor 展开、只保留一阶项。这套方法在小扰动下极其有效——飞机巡航、电路工作点、化学反应近平衡态都靠它。但近似的有效半径是有限的：扰动一旦变大，被丢掉的二阶以上项重新主导，线性预言失准。非线性动力学研究的正是这片「线性近似失效」的广阔区域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"非线性带来的新现象\">非线性带来的新现象</h2><p>非线性不只是「更难算的线性」，它催生了线性系统结构上不可能出现的行为。下表对照两个世界能产生的现象。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>线性系统</th>\n<th>非线性系统</th>\n<th>本 hub 主讲处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解的叠加</td>\n<td>成立</td>\n<td>一般不成立</td>\n<td>本篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平衡点数目</td>\n<td>0 或唯一（或整条子空间）</td>\n<td>可多个，且随参数增减</td>\n<td><a href=\"../bifurcation/bifurcations\">分岔类型</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多稳态（依初值落入不同终态）</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>常见</td>\n<td><a href=\"phase-space\">相空间与流</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>孤立周期轨道（极限环）</td>\n<td>不存在</td>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td><a href=\"fixed-points-stability\">不动点与稳定性</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界非周期运动（混沌）</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>可能</td>\n<td><a href=\"../chaos/sensitive-dependence\">敏感依赖与 Lyapunov</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对初值的指数敏感</td>\n<td>否（误差线性增长）</td>\n<td>可以（蝴蝶效应）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../chaos/sensitive-dependence\">敏感依赖与 Lyapunov</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最关键的是最后两行：一个完全确定、维数低至 3 的连续系统，竟能产生永不重复、对初值指数敏感的轨道。这在 1963 年被 Lorenz 用一组简化的对流方程意外发现，颠覆了「确定即可预测」的古典信念。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个最小的非线性例子\">一个最小的非线性例子</h2><p>考虑单摆，不做小角度近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ddot{\\theta} + \\frac{g}{L}\\sin\\theta = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0146em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是非线性的全部来源。小角度时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin\\theta \\approx \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，方程退化为简谐振动，周期与振幅无关；但大摆角下周期随振幅增大，且系统出现了两类拓扑不同的运动——来回摆动与绕轴翻转，二者被一条特殊轨迹（分界线）隔开。再给它加上周期驱动与阻尼，受迫阻尼摆就能进入混沌。同一个物理对象，仅因保留了一个非线性项，行为的丰富程度天差地别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"研究纲领-定性而非定量\">研究纲领：定性而非定量</h2><p>面对「大多数非线性方程没有解析解」这一残酷事实，Poincaré 在 19 世纪末确立了影响至今的研究纲领：不去求精确公式，而问几何与定性问题——平衡点在哪、稳不稳、轨道长期趋向何方、参数变化时结构如何突变。下图勾勒本 hub 据此展开的逻辑链。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[非线性系统&lt;br/&gt;叠加失效] --&gt; B[相空间几何&lt;br/&gt;把演化看成流动]&#10;  B --&gt; C[不动点与&lt;br/&gt;局部稳定性分类]&#10;  C --&gt; D[参数变化&lt;br/&gt;分岔: 结构突变]&#10;  D --&gt; E[倍周期级联&lt;br/&gt;通往混沌]&#10;  E --&gt; F[混沌: 敏感依赖&lt;br/&gt;奇异吸引子]&#10;  F --&gt; G[应用: 控制&lt;br/&gt;预测 与 重构]\">flowchart TD\n  A[非线性系统&lt;br/&gt;叠加失效] --&gt; B[相空间几何&lt;br/&gt;把演化看成流动]\n  B --&gt; C[不动点与&lt;br/&gt;局部稳定性分类]\n  C --&gt; D[参数变化&lt;br/&gt;分岔: 结构突变]\n  D --&gt; E[倍周期级联&lt;br/&gt;通往混沌]\n  E --&gt; F[混沌: 敏感依赖&lt;br/&gt;奇异吸引子]\n  F --&gt; G[应用: 控制&lt;br/&gt;预测 与 重构]</pre><p>这条链解释了本 hub 的章节顺序：每一步都以前一步为前提。理解了「为什么非线性值得单独研究」，下一步自然是建立描述它的统一几何语言——相空间，见 <a href=\"phase-space\">相空间与流</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其它学科的边界\">与其它学科的边界</h2><p>非线性动力学与若干兄弟学科紧密相邻，但立场不同。它研究的演化规则若是常微分方程，求解技巧（分离变量、积分因子、存在唯一性）属于 <a href=\"../../differential-equations/higher-order-linear/characteristic-equation\">微分方程 (17)</a>，本 hub 直接借用而不重复。当系统被随机噪声驱动、演化带有概率成分时，立场切换到 <a href=\"../../stochastic-processes/foundations/concepts-classification\">随机过程 (23)</a>——本 hub 始终坚持「确定性」。把动力学当成解决现实问题（人口、传染病）的建模手段，则是 <a href=\"../../mathematical-modeling/continuous-models/dynamical-systems\">数学建模 (12)</a> 的领地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>线性系统的好处（解析解、叠加、命运简单）只在小扰动下成立；现实世界大多非线性。</li>\n<li>非线性催生线性系统结构上不可能的现象：多稳态、极限环、混沌、对初值的指数敏感。</li>\n<li>单摆保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 即从简谐振动跃迁到可混沌，是非线性威力的最小演示。</li>\n<li>Poincaré 纲领：放弃解析解，转而问定性几何问题——平衡、稳定、长期趋向、结构突变。</li>\n<li>本 hub 据此分四步递进；本篇只负责动机与边界，几何语言留给下一篇。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一步：<a href=\"phase-space\">相空间与流</a> — 把任意阶系统统一成相空间里的流动。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"fixed-points-stability\">不动点与稳定性</a> — 极限环与多稳态的局部判据。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../differential-equations/systems-and-qualitative/stability-and-chaos\">微分方程 · 稳定性与混沌</a> — 从 ODE 视角看同一现象。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../mathematical-modeling/continuous-models/dynamical-systems\">数学建模 · 动力系统</a> — 把非线性动力学用于现实建模。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何非线性动力学","id":"为何非线性动力学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：线性的承诺与它的边界","id":"核心概念-线性的承诺与它的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"非线性带来的新现象","id":"非线性带来的新现象"},{"level":2,"text":"一个最小的非线性例子","id":"一个最小的非线性例子"},{"level":2,"text":"研究纲领：定性而非定量","id":"研究纲领-定性而非定量"},{"level":2,"text":"与其它学科的边界","id":"与其它学科的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"相空间与流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/foundations/phase-space"}}